[NEW] &lt;p&gt;This feature extends support for the Standard Audit File for Tax (SAF-T) format to Iceland, allowing customers in this counmtry to generate audit files using the established SAF-T framework. Key capabilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable SAF-T audit file generation for companies operating in Icela (GA: April CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Business Central

