&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable SAF-T audit file generation for companies operating in Austri (GA: April CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Business Central

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Create more complete audit export packages with less manual preparation by exporting European Business Profile (euBP) information together with transactional audit data. Organizations using the German localization can include both in a single Audit Files Export process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits:&lt;br&gt;
•	Exp (GA: January CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Business Central

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Handle VAT correctly for vendors that operate across multiple European Union countries by recording multiple VAT numbers and applying the appropriate VAT Business Posting Group and General Business Posting Group for each transaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;
•	Support multiple VAT numbers for a single (GA: October CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Business Central

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Spend less time manually adding attendees to meal-related business expenses. Expense Agent can match the expense to the relevant Outlook calendar event and add invited guests as expense participants, helping keep participant information aligned with the meeting invitation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;
•	A (GA: April CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Business Central

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Manage expenses across multiple Business Central companies and environments more efficiently with the Expense Agent web app. Switch between the companies and environments you’re authorized to access within a single session, without restarting the app or signing in again.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;
•	Acc (GA: April CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Business Central

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Make expenses easier to organize and categorize by adding relevant tags when you create or edit expenses in the web application. Add one or more custom tags to capture business, project, event, or other dimensional context beyond standard expense fields.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;
•	Add one or more cust (GA: April CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Business Central

